            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Recommendation by Use Case -->
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-14">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary mb-8">Which Option Is Right for Your Situation?</h2>
    <div class="space-y-5">
      {[
        {
          situation: 'Full landscape redesign — new planting plan, hardscape, irrigation',
          rec: 'Contact a local Murrieta specialist directly. This project requires someone who knows EVMWD/RCWD rebate programs, can specify drought-tolerant species that survive inland SoCal summers, and understands your HOA approval process. Murrieta Landscaping handles this end to end.',
        },
        {
          situation: 'HOA notice — you need a specific type of change approved',
          rec: 'You need a landscaper who knows your specific HOA\'s plant palette and hardscape rules. Nextdoor neighbors in your community are a good starting point; Murrieta Landscaping has worked with most major Murrieta HOAs.',
